| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 2 | 4 | 4 | 4 |
| 4 | 12 | 12 | 16 |
| 8 | 28 | 28 | 256 |
| 16 | 60 | 60 | 65536 |
| 32 | 124 | 124 | 4294967296 |

Whole inference entries 20; one below rejected true; exact bound forward rows 2; original fourteen-step entries 140.
Checked controls: ragged model before quota true; sixteen-path enumeration cap15 rejected true; virtual path-count overflow true; owned result after caller edits true.
